'''''When Business Comes Knocking''''' is an [[Adventure Mission]] on [[Jarilo-VI]].

==Steps==
# Go to the designated spot at Everwinter Hill and investigate the unknown signal
# Report to the crew about the results of the investigation
# Go learn about Belobog's history from Bronya
# Look for the ''Belobog Chronicles'' in the bookcase
# Report in once again to the crew about the results of the investigation
# Ask Asta about Findie's origins

