::'''Asta:''' You're back. Did you conclude the matter?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I got the Xenohydro back...
::'''Asta:''' Well, don't worry, the Xenohydro is of secondary importance... Is that Lamina standing with Capote over there?
