::'''Angry Master Capote Fan:''' You fraud. You trampled on our sincerity.
::'''Heartbroken Master Capote Fan:''' Oh, Master Capote used to be so perfect, and now he is just another deceitful celebrity...
::'''Wen Shiling:''' Master Capote! I can't believe you eat mayonnaise. That's disgusting! Give me back the gifts I gave you!
::'''Capote:''' Lamina, why did you invite all these people?
::'''Lamina:''' I didn't invite them here. I just told them the fact that I was the one who replied to all your fans.
::'''Capote:''' Everybody calm down, let me explain later... Lamina, you don't want the benefits I give you at all anymore, do you?
::'''Lamina:''' That's right, I don't want any of it. From now on, I won't help you cook, wash your clothes and shoes, write your letters, or be your puppet. Get it?
::'''Lamina:''' If you want to find me, remember to ask my secretary Mr. Nonexistent for a number.
::'''Asta:''' (Trailblazer), what do you think of this?
