::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't know what they are arguing about.
:::'''Asta:''' I didn't think you can be so tight-lipped, but now, we should be honest and clear this up.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} She'll be able to look after herself.
:::'''Asta:''' Yes, thanks to your mediation. Not only did you ensure her safety, but also encouraged her to change.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You seem to know the back story.
:::'''Asta:''' I thought I was careful, but you still noticed.
::'''Asta:''' ...Oops, "Like the risk of falling into the depths when trying to mount the sky." I didn't use any rhymes or enough alliteration for this line. It's still not good enough.
::'''Asta:''' Hehe, to tell you the truth, the Cryptologist From Locus Silentii is none other than yours truly. This letter took me more than ten days to write, and I asked Mr. Wen for advice. It wasn't easy.
::'''Asta:''' After I wrote it, I couldn't find the right person to get it delivered. Fortunately, the Xenohydro is just a prankster, and there's no rush to retrieve it.
::'''Asta:''' Then you appeared, (Trailblazer). And you turned out to be the best candidate. So I came up with the idea to let you and Lamina share some experiences together, see where it takes you.
::'''Asta:''' But now you should also understand that Lamina is actually a kindhearted girl and she deserves another chance.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You are also very kind.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} She is bound to turn over a new leaf.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why go around this massive circle?
::'''Asta:''' Well, now that my objective has been achieved, I announce the Xenohydro case is officially over. Here is your reward. Thanks for all your help.
::'''Asta:''' Please come back to the space station more in the future. Don't forget, there are a lot of people who've received your help here, and many traces of your hard work throughout the place.
